title: "Iter Sibiricum: European travelogues about Siberia and its peoples, 1800–1930"
abstract: >-
  A digital research resource on how European travellers of 1800–1930 described the peoples of Siberia
  and the relations between them: a corpus of 109 travelogues in 9 languages with full texts, routes
  reconstructed from the texts, cards of peoples, illustrations from the books, analytics and the
  reproducible processing pipeline. Prepared with the support of Russian Science Foundation grant
  No. 25-28-20397 and the Government of the Altai Republic.
